Chris Ball and Josef Bacik have just updated their work on system
rollback with btrfs in Fedora 13.

    *  Targeted release:  Fedora 13
    * Last updated: 2010-01-15
    * Percentage of completion: 80%

    * Kernel patches for listing subvols and setting default
subvolumes are submitted to btrfs list, hopefully going to Linus
within two weeks
    * Josef has submitted several iterations of a yum plugin
    * Palimpsest code has not been started yet, waiting for kernel
patches to hit the Fedora kernel

https://fedoraproject.org/wiki/Features/SystemRollbackWithBtrfs
